{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261019/photo/bkn-20261019113918231-1019_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261019115119\"/><p>尖沙咀文化中心發生火警。</p><p>尖沙咀發生火警。今晨(19日)11時23分，梳士巴利道10號香港文化中心職員報案，指上址一舞台後方起火，一名女職員被燒傷。救援人員接報到場，消防開動一條喉及派出一隊煙帽隊在場戒備，受傷清醒女職員由救護車送院治理，起火原因有待調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T03:58:56.133454+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T03:39:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T03:57:34.435805+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T03:57:34.435805+00:00","content_hash":"15c53b04479d154b5ed5b3563e535658e4710f753b0781c3c7f18a70410dd2f7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}